                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The Next Morning",
                                  "The festival\nchecklist ends\nafter decorations,\nmusic, and food\nwith",
                                  "a separate page:\nTomorrow. It names\ncleaning duties,\nthe first",
                                  "inspection, and\nwho answers the\ndesk. Pip drew a\nsun beside that",
                                  "heading. A\nfestival that\nleaves a working\nmorning is his\nfavorite",
                                  "kind."
                                ],
